---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description={`About ${site.name} — a cycling journal for riders who travel, and travellers who pedal this planet.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="site-shell about">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">{site.name}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{site.tagline}</p>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          This is a home for people who like bikes, and for people who like to go and see things.
          Climbs, coast roads, café tables, overnight trains with a bike in the luggage car,
          villages you only notice because your legs got you there.
        </p>
        <p>
          We all need a little nudge sometimes — a push toward the next honest kilometre. Too often
          we wait for someone else to hand us the map. This journal is a reminder that the map is
          already in the handlebar bag. Clip in. Look around. This planet is worth the detour.
        </p>
        <p>
          Consider the rest of the tour a present, packed neatly, sitting just out of reach. The
          card says “do not touch.” Of course you want to open it. Maybe waiting — and taking a
          small peek around the next bend — is enough.
        </p>
        <blockquote>
          Be confident in your choices. Sometimes riding the “wrong” road shows you a place you
          never would have found with a perfect plan.
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          For the dreamers, the believers, and the hopeful — on two wheels, looking at this
          wonderful planet. The site is ours: rides, notes from the saddle, and room to grow.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/journal">Notes from the saddle</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/contact">Wave from the road</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .lead {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.7rem);
    color: rgba(238, 243, 247, 0.9);
  }

  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
